<# Input of the dashboard builder (dashboard/build.py, run by deploy.py): the card config of the energy screen, the
   config of the analysis data generators, the feature flags, the dashboards and the texts of the analysis views, all
   rendered from house.yaml by tools/fill.py (_energy.jinja). JSON: no YAML quoting, no Home Assistant template checks. #>
